  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WCO/World Bank Customs Capacity Enhancement (CCEP-SSA)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall Project Development Objective (PDO) for the project is to enhance the capacity of Customs Administrations to coordinate and drive their own reform and modernization initiatives and ensure officials are able to apply international standards in the delivery of government objectives.  Specifically, the project will contribute to the achievement of national trade facilitation and economic development objectives through:  the preparation of better-designed and targeted capacity building programmes focused on improving Customs efficiency and effectiveness; better coordination and deployment of international assistance; the acquisition of customs technical and operational skills; improved compliance to international standards; and the empowerment of administrations to manage and sustain their improvements and to cope with further change in a dynamic and sustainable way.</narrative>
  </description>
